traits.smithy.api#documentation:
ARN of the AWS Config Recorder provisioned by this Collector.
Accepts both recorder shapes:
  - Customer-Managed:  ...:config-recorder/{name}
  - Service-Linked:    ...:configuration-recorder/{name}/{id}
(a service-linked recorder ARN from PutServiceLinkedConfigurationRecorder uses
the `configuration-recorder` resource type and carries a trailing id segment).

Whether the issue has any attached evidence (formerly 'artifacts':
tool output, remediation proposals, patches). NONE = no evidence;
AVAILABLE = at least one evidence item exists. Computed at read time.
